@startuml despliegue-web
' Telar — Diagrama de despliegue UML · Modo WEB (docker compose completo)
' Fuente de verdad: compose.yaml (raíz), frontend/nginx.conf, frontend/Dockerfile,
' backend/Dockerfile, backend/app/services/docker_service.py, architecture.md §2.2/§2.3.
' Render (sin Graphviz):  java -jar plantuml.jar -tsvg despliegue-web.puml
!pragma layout smetana

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 28
skinparam ranksep 42
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam ArrowFontSize 11
skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #222222
  BorderThickness 1.4
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam artifact {
  BackgroundColor #F7F4F1
  BorderColor #222222
  FontStyle plain
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #222222
}

title Telar — Diagrama de despliegue · **modo web** (docker compose completo)

node "<<device>>\n:MáquinaAnfitriona\n{WSL2 / Linux · el MISMO equipo que el cliente}" as HOST {

  node "<<executionEnvironment>>\n:Navegador\n{Chromium / Firefox}" as BROWSER {
    artifact "<<artifact>>\nindex.html + assets/\n{build Vite · SPA React + HashRouter}" as SPA_W
  }

  node "<<executionEnvironment>>\n:Docker Engine\n{/var/run/docker.sock}" as DOCKERD {

    node "<<container>>\ntelar-frontend\n{127.0.0.1:8080 → :80 · nginx:alpine}" as NGINX {
      artifact "<<artifact>>\n/usr/share/nginx/html/\n{estáticos del build Vite}" as STATIC
      artifact "<<artifact>>\ndefault.conf\n{proxy /api/ /ws/ /health}" as NGINXCONF
    }

    node "<<container>>\ntelar-backend\n{127.0.0.1:8000 · healthcheck /health}" as BACKEND_W {
      artifact "<<artifact>>\ntelar-backend\n{FastAPI 0.139 + uvicorn · 1 worker}\n{TELAR_ADMIN_BUILD=0 → build estudiante}" as BACK_IMG_W
    }

    node "<<container>>\ntelar-run-<jobId>\n{efímero: 1 por job · máx. 2 concurrentes}\n{network=none · user=10001 · cap-drop=ALL}\n{read-only + tmpfs /tmp · mem=512m · pids=128}" as RUNNER_W {
      artifact "<<artifact>>\ntelar-runner:0.5.1\n{python:3.12-slim + pyomp 0.5.1}" as RUN_IMG_W
      artifact "<<artifact>>\n/work/main.py\n{código del estudiante · solo lectura}" as CODE_W
    }

    database "<<volume>>\ntelar_data" as VOLDATA_W {
      artifact "<<artifact>>\ntelar.db\n{SQLite · WAL}" as DB_W
    }

    database "<<volume>>\ntelar_submissions" as VOLSUBS_W {
      artifact "<<artifact>>\n<jobId>/main.py" as SUBS_W
    }
  }
}

BROWSER --> NGINX : <<HTTP>>\nhttp://127.0.0.1:8080\n(estáticos + REST + WS, mismo origen)
NGINX --> BACKEND_W : <<HTTP>>\nproxy_pass http://backend:8000\n/api/ · /health
NGINX --> BACKEND_W : <<WebSocket>>\nproxy_pass /ws/ (Upgrade)\nread_timeout=3600s
BACKEND_W --> DOCKERD : <<docker-py 7.2>>\nsocket Unix montado :rw
DOCKERD --> RUNNER_W : create · start · wait\nstats · kill · remove
BACKEND_W --> VOLDATA_W : <<mount rw>>\n/app/data
BACKEND_W --> VOLSUBS_W : <<mount rw>>\n/submissions
VOLSUBS_W --> RUNNER_W : <<mount ro>>\nsubpath=<jobId> → /work

legend bottom
  **Diferencias frente al modo escritorio**
  1 · El cliente es el navegador y aparece nginx como servidor de estáticos y proxy
  inverso: el frontend habla con /api y /ws en su MISMO origen (127.0.0.1:8080), no
  contra el puerto 8000.
  2 · nginx y backend se resuelven por el DNS interno de la red bridge que crea
  Compose (el host "backend" del proxy_pass es el nombre del servicio).
  3 · El resto del despliegue es idéntico: mismo build de Vite, mismo backend, mismo
  runner efímero, mismos dos volúmenes con nombre explícito.
endlegend

@enduml
